# Keep the working tree LF on every platform, including Windows checkouts where
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true. Without this, a checkout
# rewrites LF to CRLF, and gofmt then reports every Go file as unformatted,
# because gofmt requires LF line endings. Normalized content also keeps
# cross-platform diffs, archives, and release checksums predictable.
* text=auto eol=lf
